## 3. Non-Deterministic Circuits

Multiple valid witnesses for same public inputs enable forgery.

```circom
// VULNERABLE - ZK Email regex could match invalid characters
// UTF-8 \xff character bypasses regex validation
template EmailRegex(msgBytes) {
    signal input msg[msgBytes];
    signal output match;
    
    // Missing: range check on input characters
    // Attacker injects \xff to break DFA state machine
}

// SECURE - validate input range
template EmailRegex(msgBytes) {
    signal input msg[msgBytes];
    signal output match;
    
    // Ensure all characters are valid ASCII
    for (var i = 0; i < msgBytes; i++) {
        assert(msg[i] < 128);  // Valid ASCII only
    }
    // ... rest of regex logic
}
```

