## 4. Memory Operation Issues (zkVM)

```rust
// VULNERABLE - zkSync memory write without constraint
// Higher 128 bits unconstrained in MemoryWriteQuery
impl RawMemoryQuery {
    fn from_key_and_value_witness(...) {
        let mut lc = LinearCombination::zero();
        // Constraint not enforced!
        // Attacker can manipulate high bits
    }
}

// ATTACK:
// 1. Value 0x1337 written to memory
// 2. Attacker modifies to 0x152d0000133713371337 (100K ETH)
// 3. Proof passes verification
// 4. Attacker withdraws inflated amount

// SECURE - enforce constraint
fn from_key_and_value_witness(...) {
    let mut lc = LinearCombination::zero();
    lc.enforce_zero(cs)?;  // Actually apply constraint
}
```

