## 5. Instruction Operation Vulnerabilities

```rust
// VULNERABLE - LOAD operation doesn't verify register value
// SP1/Jolt VM example
builder.when(local.selectors.is_load).assert_block_eq(
    *memory_cols.memory.prev_value(),
    *memory_cols.memory.value(),  // Only checks memory unchanged
);
// Missing: verify local.a == memory value!

// SECURE - verify loaded value matches memory
builder.when(local.selectors.is_load).assert_block_eq(
    *local.a.value(),            // Register must equal
    *memory_cols.memory.value(), // memory value
);
```

