## 6. Compilation/Polynomial Issues

```go
// VULNERABLE - Linea PLONK prover
// Quotient polynomial sub-polynomials not blinded
func commitToQuotient(h1, h2, h3 []fr.Element, proof *Proof, ...) {
    // h1, h2, h3 committed without blinding
    // Attacker can analyze commitments to recover witness
}

// SECURE - blind polynomials
func commitToQuotient(h1, h2, h3 []fr.Element, proof *Proof, ...) {
    if StatisticalZK {
        h1 = blindPolynomial(h1)
        h2 = blindPolynomial(h2)
        h3 = blindPolynomial(h3)
    }
    // Now safe to commit
}
```

