## Cairo-Specific Issues

```cairo
// VULNERABLE - division doesn't revert on zero
let result = a / b;  // If b = 0, silently returns 0

// SECURE - explicit check
assert b != 0;
let result = a / b;

// VULNERABLE - felt252 overflow wraps
let x: felt252 = PRIME - 1;
let y = x + 2;  // Wraps, y = 1

// SECURE - use bounded integers
use core::integer::u256;
```

