## ZK Audit Checklist

### Circuit Design
- [ ] All signals properly constrained (no <-- without <==)
- [ ] Range checks on all inputs
- [ ] No under-constrained variables
- [ ] No non-deterministic paths

### Polynomial/Proof System
- [ ] Polynomial blinding applied where needed
- [ ] Commitments don't leak witness information
- [ ] Fiat-Shamir transcript includes all public inputs

### VM/Execution
- [ ] Memory operations fully constrained
- [ ] All opcodes correctly implemented
- [ ] I/O addresses validated independently
- [ ] Termination conditions checked

### Recursive Proofs
- [ ] All layers check completion criteria
- [ ] Public inputs properly propagated
- [ ] No unconstrained intermediate values

### Integration
- [ ] Verifier rejects malformed proofs
- [ ] Public inputs correctly extracted
- [ ] Cross-system boundaries validated
